---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Gemeinsam loslegen
fullTitle: Kontakt und Anfrage – Gemeinsam loslegen mit EDUSOL
description: Nehmt Kontakt mit EDUSOL auf – wir beraten euch zu Coaching, Supervision, Schulentwicklung, Krisenmanagement, NPO-Beratung und Fachvorträgen.
permalink: /kontakt.html
pageScript: /assets/js/contact-form.js
hideCta: true
---
<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="container hero__inner stack stack-md">
    <p class="eyebrow">Wir freuen uns, von euch zu hören</p>
    <h1 class="h-page">Gemeinsam loslegen</h1>
    <p class="lead">Erzählt uns kurz, worum es geht. Wir melden uns innerhalb von 48 Stunden mit einem Vorschlag.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white">
  <div class="container contact-layout">
    <div class="contact-layout__main stack stack-lg">
      <div id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>

      <div class="panel panel--soft" id="form-success" tabindex="-1" hidden>
        <img src="/assets/img/eulen/logo.svg" width="70" height="64" alt="">
        <h2 class="h-small">Danke – eure Anfrage ist bei uns.</h2>
        <p>Wir melden uns innerhalb von 48 Stunden bei euch.</p>
        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/">← Zur Startseite</a></p>
      </div>

      <form class="form" id="contact-form" action="{{ site.formAction }}" method="POST" data-fallback-email="{{ site.email }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Neue Anfrage über edusol.ch">
        <div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="website">Dieses Feld bitte leer lassen</label>
          <input type="text" id="website" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </div>

        <fieldset class="form-step">
          <legend class="form-step__title">1. Worum geht es? <span class="hint">(optional)</span></legend>
          <div class="chips">
            {%- for f in fields %}
            <label class="chip theme-{{ f.slug }}">
              <input type="radio" name="thema" value="{{ f.title }}" data-slug="{{ f.slug }}">
              <span><img src="/assets/img/eulen/{{ f.slug }}.svg" width="28" height="26" alt="">{{ f.menuTitle }}</span>
            </label>
            {%- endfor %}
            <label class="chip">
              <input type="radio" name="thema" value="Anderes" data-slug="anderes">
              <span><img src="/assets/img/eulen/logo.svg" width="28" height="26" alt="">Anderes</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <p class="callout callout--crisis" id="crisis-hint" hidden>
            <span><strong>Ist es akut?</strong> Dann ruft uns direkt an – {{ site.akutHoursShort }}.</span>
            <a href="/akut.html">Zur Akut-Hilfe →</a>
          </p>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="form-step">
          <legend class="form-step__title">2. Wer seid ihr?</legend>
          <div class="field-row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Vor- und Nachname</label>
              <input class="input" type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="name-error">
              <p class="field-error" id="name-error" hidden></p>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">E-Mail</label>
              <input class="input" type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" spellcheck="false" required aria-describedby="email-error">
              <p class="field-error" id="email-error" hidden></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="link-button" type="button" id="more-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="more-fields" hidden>+ Telefon &amp; Organisation angeben (optional)</button>
          <div class="field-row" id="more-fields">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="telefon">Telefon <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="input" type="tel" id="telefon" name="telefon" autocomplete="tel">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="organisation">Schule, Verein, Unternehmen <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="input" type="text" id="organisation" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization">
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="form-step">
          <div class="field">
            <label class="form-step__title" for="nachricht">3. Eure Nachricht</label>
            <textarea class="input" id="nachricht" name="nachricht" rows="5" required aria-describedby="nachricht-error"></textarea>
            <p class="field-error" id="nachricht-error" hidden></p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="form-privacy">
          Eure Angaben werden über den Formulardienst Formspree (USA) an uns übermittelt und nur zur Bearbeitung eurer Anfrage verwendet.
          Details in der <a href="/datenschutz.html#kontaktformular">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="form-submit">
          <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" type="submit">Anfrage senden</button>
          <span class="hint">Unverbindlich · Antwort innerhalb 48 h</span>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <aside class="contact-layout__aside" aria-label="Weitere Kontaktwege">
      <div class="panel panel--soft">
        <h2>Lieber direkt?</h2>
        <p class="stack">
          <span class="panel__meta">E-Mail</span>
          <a class="panel__email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
        </p>
        {%- if site.whatsapp %}
        <a class="btn btn--whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Schreib uns auf WhatsApp<span class="visually-hidden"> (öffnet in neuem Tab)</span></a>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="panel panel--line">
        <h2>Wie es weitergeht</h2>
        <ol class="steps steps--compact">
          {%- for st in steps %}
          <li class="steps__item"><span class="num" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span><p><strong>{{ st.title }}</strong> {{ st.text }}</p></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
